note contract 5 fresh, line 127: passing the fresh array to part is error 27, even after every
note element is written.
om2
fn h v view uchar * to ulong
ret len v
end
fn f s edit uchar 8 fresh to ulong
for i ulong 8 unroll
put s i 1
end
ret h part s 0 4
end
fn main to int
a = new uchar 8 0
putd f a
ret 0
end
